                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Planned Parenthood provides life-saving care for over 2 million patients each year\u2014often as the only provider patients see all year. President & CEO Nicole Clegg of @ppnnehealth made it clear: Defunding them puts lives at risk. Republicans\u2019 Big Ugly Bill risks closing 200 clinics over 24 states, putting more than a million patients\u2019 health at risk.\n\nWe must fight to protect our reproductive freedom.",
