                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Contraception is health care\u2014and it\u2019s under threat. If states like Virginia can\u2019t guarantee the right to birth control, Congress must. We need federal protections to expand access, stop refusals, and ensure coverage. The right to birth control should be the law of the land.\n@REPRORising_VA",
