                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Patients are more likely to die in the ER when private equity buys a hospital.\n\nThat\u2019s the price of corporate greed. This is why I will continue to fight for my Health Over Wealth Act\u2014to protect patients, providers, and communities. https://t.co/dw5SLABUSh",
