                "text": "Trump and Republicans are holding health care for 337,000 Massachusetts residents hostage.\n\nIf they get their way, you might have to pay three times as much next year for the same coverage you have right now.\n\nThis is unacceptable and it's unsustainable. https://t.co/i1POXuJnor",
