                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Trump and MAGA Republicans are holding health care hostage. Premiums up. Rural hospitals at risk. Millions losing coverage. I\u2019m standing with my colleagues to say NO to health care cuts. We will fight to protect health care for every American. https://t.co/VhK6SHqMlq",
